  "title": "Mango Chutney",
  "description": "This mango chutney is made with fresh mangos, raisins, ginger, onion, garlic, and lots of spices like cinnamon and cloves. Get those jars ready!",
  "authors": [
    "Shirley Crowley"
  ],
